Devine anger, alignment hurt, prayer timeout, any message
from your diety could mean any one of these.  The lesson
is when you get an unexpected message write it down
exactly and go find out what it means.  Then deal with it
knowing your exact situation not by guessing.

Additional lesson - When you get such a message remember
to proceed to a co-aligned altar and sacrafice to repair
the damage (*not* prayer until the damage is repaired).
The messages at sacrafice time tell you your situation.



